WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.7 · Marketing & Communications
Email, newsletters and supporter journeys

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Fifty people who asked to hear from you are worth more than a borrowed list of thousands.

3
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:27.763
Email lets you own the relationship with people who chose to hear from you. A newsletter keeps them informed; a journey is a planned sequence of messages triggered by an action, such as signing up.

4
00:00:28.163 --> 00:00:28.763
Three building blocks

5
00:00:28.763 --> 00:00:37.870
A consented list: Contacts collected with clear consent, starting from your first conversations. For example: Fifty neighbours who signed up at the bakery’s market stall.

6
00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:46.978
Newsletter: Regular updates that keep people informed. For example: A monthly note: what we baked, the next market dates and one trainee story.

7
00:00:46.978 --> 00:01:00.619
Welcome journey: Three emails after sign-up: thanks, the difference you aim for, how to get involved. For example: Day 1, thank you; day 4, why the traineeships matter; day 10, how to pre-order.

8
00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:01.619
Why it matters

9
00:01:01.619 --> 00:01:07.293
1. Fifty people who asked to hear from you beat thousands borrowed.

10
00:01:07.293 --> 00:01:12.226
2. A welcome journey builds relationships far better than silence.

11
00:01:12.226 --> 00:01:18.530
3. You do not depend on a platform changing its rules.

12
00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:19.530
Where you will use it

13
00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:24.093
1. Your launch: a list ready before you open.

14
00:01:24.093 --> 00:01:27.915
2. Your campaigns and calls for support.

15
00:01:27.915 --> 00:01:33.107
3. Your measurement: replies, sign-ups and repeat support.

16
00:01:33.507 --> 00:01:34.107
What to avoid

17
00:01:34.107 --> 00:01:38.670
Adding people without consent, or making unsubscribing hard.

18
00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:43.233
Vague subject lines that hide what is inside.

19
00:01:43.233 --> 00:01:48.056
Measuring only opens instead of actions.

20
00:01:48.656 --> 00:01:50.456
You design your first newsletter and one welcome journey.

21
00:01:50.456 --> 00:01:54.456
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

22
00:01:55.956 --> 00:01:59.056
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
